# Allowlist: only the files the image build needs enter the build context.
# Everything else in the monorepo (docs, tests, tooling, local env files,
# stray archives) stays out, which keeps builds fast and secrets out of layers.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps
!packages

# Generated output and local-only files inside the allowed trees. The image
# rebuilds all of these from source.
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/dist
**/.netlify
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.stryker-tmp

# Never copy environment files: configuration is injected at runtime.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Tests and test tooling are not part of the shipped app.
**/tests
**/test
**/e2e
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/playwright.config.ts
**/vitest.config.*

# Editor and agent metadata
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.claude
**/*.md
